{"id":"vdol_","lemma":"вдоль","pos":"prep","rank":2122,"glosses":["along"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d3/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Дорога идёт вдоль реки.","en":"The road follows the river.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/196161","words":[{"g":"road"},{"g":"to go","l":"идти"},null,{"g":"river, stream","l":"река"}]},{"text":"Вдоль дороги идёт забор.","en":"A fence runs along the road.","words":[null,{"g":"road","l":"дорога"},{"g":"to go","l":"идти"},{"g":"fence"}]},{"text":"Мы шли вдоль реки.","en":"We walked along the river.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/738469","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to send, to dispatch","l":"слать"},null,{"g":"river, stream","l":"река"}]},{"text":"Он шел вдоль реки.","en":"He walked along the river.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,null,{"g":"river, stream","l":"река"}]},{"text":"Я часто гулял вдоль этой реки.","en":"I used to often take walks along that river.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"frequently, often"},{"g":"to walk","l":"гулять"},null,null,{"g":"river, stream","l":"река"}]}]}